    "module_designation": "Analog load cell",
    "description": "Family of automatic catchweighing instruments designated HSC350, operating as automatic checkweighers (Category X) and/or weigh or weigh-price labellers (Category Y). Stainless steel construction: fabricated floor-standing frame on adjustable feet carrying a modular conveyor (conveyor type, number, size and shape not restricted), equipped with reject devices (flipper, drop flap, ram or air blast) for Category X and/or thermal label printers for Category Y; designed for permanent installation. Control cabinet behind the instrument houses the electrical hardware; a PL30 weighing indicator console with keyboard and displays is mounted above the cabinet; photocells (direct reading, reflex or laser type) on the frame provide pack detection. Approved alternatives: 1) transport system 'R chain' with two 1/4-inch plastic chains sliding on plastic bars; 2) PL30 indicator enclosed in the cabinet; 3) multi-lane configuration with one separate PL30 per lane and a common cabinet; 4) PL30 with touch screen display, long-term data storage device and optional integrated printer; 5) 10.2 inch touch screen HMI; 6) modified AD board PL555E (drawing rev 1 dated 12/12/2013) covering models HSC350/02, /04, /08, /20 and /40."
